<title>CHILE: Chile's Cartones reports lower Q1 net.</title>
<headline>Chile's Cartones reports lower Q1 net.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean paper pulp company Compania Manufacturera de Papeles y Cartones SA (CMPC) reported the following results for the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>			    Q1 1997		  Q1 1996</p>
<p> Net profit		8.4	     profit 15.1</p>
<p> Operating loss	  1.6		 loss  1.3</p>
<p> Non-operating profit  9.3	     profit 16.2</p>
<p> Total revenues	156 million		 4.0</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in billions of Chilean pesos except where noted.</p>
<p>The company reported Q1 profits from related company investments at 10.1 billion pesos vs 17.3 billion pesos.</p>
<p>((--Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-6995595 x211))</p>
